{%- comment -%}
  Section: ds-review-base  (Step 6 — SHARED review / product-pick hub)
  Purpose: Reusable, settings+blocks-driven commercial REVIEW page. Page #1 is the
           Heavy-Duty & 24/7 office chairs hub; pages #2–4 (law firms / clinics /
           executive) reuse this SAME section and supply their own content via their
           page.review-*.json template — no per-page section forks.
  Used by: page.review-heavy-duty.json (handle: best-office-chairs-heavy-duty) and
           the later review templates.
  Sections: nav → breadcrumbs → hero → intro (answer-first) + E-E-A-T byline →
            best-for use-cases → spec COMPARISON (chair blocks, data-driven from each
            product's specs.* metafields — same single source as the PDP) →
            what-to-look-for (feature blocks) → cross-link tiles → entity/OECM note →
            FAQ (faq_item blocks) → CTA closer → footer → entity JSON-LD.
  Blocks:   `chair`    — one anchor product per block (product picker). Its specs.*
                         metafields are the ONLY spec source rendered (no hand-typed
                         figures). Carrier gate: only wire CARRIED products.
            `feature`  — a "what to look for" / differentiator card.
            `faq_item` — one Q/A. Visible accordion AND bbi-faq-jsonld are built from
                         the SAME blocks (question + "||" + answer, split on "~~~"),
                         so the schema text byte-matches the on-page Q/A (SCHEMA-CRIT-1).
                         Block copy must never contain "||" or "~~~".
  JSON-LD:  Organization/LocalBusiness is emitted by bbi-nav → bbi-org-schema and is
            NOT re-emitted here. After the footer this page emits, exactly once each:
              • bbi-review-product-jsonld — ItemList of full Product nodes (one per
                chair block). aggregateRating/review are honesty-gated OFF until a
                product carries real owned reviews (none today) — never fabricated.
              • bbi-service-jsonld (id_suffix per template; provider → …/#organization)
              • bbi-breadcrumb-jsonld (absolute URLs assigned before the render call)
              • bbi-faq-jsonld (only if faq_item blocks exist)
  Specs:    No-assumed-specs. Every figure in the comparison comes from the referenced
            product's specs.* metafields (= data/specs.json, pushed live). Made-in-
            Canada + warranty are sourced from those metafields (Steve-gated copy).
  Notes:    Canadian-made / since-1964 copy carries the maple-leaf accent
            (.bbi-icon--leaf). Reuses the .lp-* vocabulary from ds-lp-* and the
            .pdp-spec-row grid from ds-pdp-base — no new design tokens.
{%- endcomment -%}

